1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:02,810
(Howard:)So listen, guys,
the reason he was up late...

2
00:00:02,976 --> 00:00:05,146
(Howard:)...is because he was taking care
of Amy.

3
00:00:05,311 --> 00:00:07,981
(Howard:)- She's kind of upset.
- Why?

4
00:00:08,148 --> 00:00:11,528
(Leonard:)Her feelings got hurt because
you went dress shopping without her.

5
00:00:11,693 --> 00:00:13,153
(Bernadette:)I told you that would happen.

6
00:00:13,319 --> 00:00:17,489
(Penny:)This is her first time being a bridesmaid,
and she's getting a Iittle crazy with it.

7
00:00:17,657 --> 00:00:21,657
(Bernadette:)She keeps on telling us stories about
bridesmaid traditions in other cuItures...

8
00:00:21,828 --> 00:00:25,368
(Bernadette:)...and they're all about getting naked
and washing each other.

9
00:00:32,881 --> 00:00:35,881
(Penny:)She keeps trying to figure out
if our cycles have synced up...

10
00:00:36,092 --> 00:00:39,092
(Penny:)...so we can call ourselves
"The Three Menstra-teers."

11
00:00:41,014 --> 00:00:44,354
(Bernadette:)We thought it would be easier
to look at dresses one time without her.

12
00:00:44,517 --> 00:00:47,557
(Bernadette:)- I feel terrible.
- I know, me too. We'll talk to her.

13
00:00:47,729 --> 00:00:49,359
(Penny:)Hey, wait, how did she find out?

14
00:00:50,607 --> 00:00:52,737
Raj did it. Ugh.

15
00:00:55,403 --> 00:01:01,023
(Howard:)And he says he would do it again.

